# Shen'dralas - Rares & Treasures companion (pack butler-routes-completionist, v1).
# The data holds no rare-flagged spawns in Shen'dralas - all 56 NPCs on the
# key were scanned and none carries the rare flag (no rank 2/4, no rare role;
# the ten rank-1s are quest givers, core targets, or lootless elites - see
# docs/shendralas-companions-inventory.md) - so this guide is treasures only,
# said plainly: one generic multi-point object looped over its fixed points
# plus one fixed unique, no kills. Run it in its own Polestar tab at the end
# of the core route or standalone. EVERY goal is optional. Spawn points are
# the local Forever game data (questie-forever). No tame lines ship (no rares,
# no beast-drop evidence, no core beast-family kills). Respawn timers are
# unconfirmed anywhere, so none are stated. This guide never accepts or turns
# in.
guide butler-routes-completionist/shendralas-rares
title Shen'dralas - Rares & Treasures
levels 30-49
zone Shen'dralas
faction Alliance
category Collectibles
folder Companions
keywords shendralas, rares, treasures, companions
coords live
version 1

step Centaur Supplies - southwestern caches

  zone map 2652

  loop
  goto 29.4,69.9
  goto 29.5,72.1
  goto 29.6,73.7
  goto 29.9,69.4
  goto 30,73
  goto 30,74.5
  goto 30.3,70.8
  goto 30.7,70.6
  goto 34.8,77.8
  interact 602101 optional
  note One supply object with nine fixed points in the southwest; check each. Contents are unconfirmed in the data; respawn timer unconfirmed.

step Evenshade's Journal - the halls

  zone map 2652

  goto 35.07,46.53
  note A fixed journal beside Mordent Evenshade's halls. Contents are unconfirmed in the data; respawn timer unconfirmed.
